hey're claiming is not true. For your context, the text you will be reading was written by a participant in an online academic survey in response to the following two questions: < Q1: ${q:\/\/QID67\/QuestionText} > < ${q:\/\/QID68\/QuestionText} >"},{"role":"user","content":"Question 1 Response: ${q:\/\/QID67\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}, Question 2 Response: ${q:\/\/QID68\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}"}],"max_tokens":150},"ContentType":"application\/json","Headers":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer REDACTED_OPENAI_KEY_ROTATE_ME"}],"ResponseMap":[{"key":"choices.0.message.content","value":"conSummary"}],"FireAndForget":false,"SchemaVersion":0,"StringifyValues":true},{"Type":"WebService","FlowID":"FL_214","URL":"https:\/\/api.openai.com\/v1\/chat\/completions","Method":"POST","RequestParams":[],"EditBodyParams":[{"key":"model","value":"gpt-4o"},{"key":"messages","value":"[\n    {\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"Determine if the following written response to a question posed in an online survey collectively contain or reflect AFFIRMATIVE belief in a conspiracy theory (or something quite like a conspiracy theory). For your context, the text you will be reading was written by a participant in an online academic survey in response to the following two questions: < Q1: ${q:\/\/QID67\/QuestionText} > < Q2: ${q:\/\/QID68\/QuestionText} > The participant's answers to these questions are piped in as the first user response of this chat. Please determine if the participant's answers to these questions contain or reflect affirmative belief in a conspiracy theory (or something quite like a conspiracy theory). If they contain or reflect affirmative belief in a conspiracy theory (or something quite like a conspiracy theory), respond only PASS; else, respond only either FAIL or AMBIGUOUS.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n        \"content\": \"Question 1 Response: ${q:\/\/QID67\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}, Question 2 Response: ${q:\/\/QID68\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}